 This is a simple utility to provide information about the color capability on your G-Windows sytems.  Just type 'colortest'. Sample output:    Window File Manager release: 2.5, edition 50             Window device name: /win                     Color type: 256 color CLUT         Number of Fixed Colors: 8    Global Color Set:    Color Name   Offset  Value    ------------ ------  -------           White  255    $EAEAEA           Black  254    $000000       Dark Grey  248    $272727     Medium Dark  249    $4E4E4E     Medium Grey  250    $757575    Medium Light  253    $9C9C9C      Light Grey  251    $C3C3C3           Blink: 252  On: EAEAEA  Off: 000000    Fixed Color Values: Start: 248   End: 256                 Offset  Value                 ------  -------                  248    $272727                  249    $4E4E4E                  250    $757575                  251    $C3C3C3                  252   <Blinking>                  253    $9C9C9C                  254    $000000                  255    $EAEAEA Stephen Carville pagan@delphi.com High G Software P.O Box 822 Glendora, CA 91740